      },
      "show_title_separator": true,
      "text": "[#](53341a)This family contains **3 distinct workings**. Each one has its own exact offerings, circles, power, and conditions; use the card belonging to the result you intend.[#]()",
      "title": "Rite of Moving Earth",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    },
    {
      "type": "modonomicon:text",
      "anchor": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "modonomicon:none"
      },
      "show_title_separator": true,
      "text": "[#](53341a)These are the three source column-raising workings despite the family name. Small, medium, and large Ritual circles choose the footprint and use Gunpowder, Redstone, or Glowstone Dust respectively. One terrain layer rises every five ticks.[#]()",
      "title": "How It Unfolds",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    },
    {
      "type": "modonomicon:text",
      "anchor": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "modonomicon:none"
      },
      "show_title_separator": false,
      "text": "[#](53341a)Only the small working accepts an optional Bound Waystone destination.[#]()",
      "title": " ",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    },
    {
      "type": "modonomicon:text",
      "anchor": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "modonomicon:none"
      },
      "show_title_separator": true,
      "text": "[#](53341a)Raise a column of earth.[#]() [#](53341a)**Required offerings:** **Brew of Sprouting**, **Cactus**, **Gunpowder**.[#]() [#](53341a)**Optional focus:** **Bound Waystone**. Optional items have a gold frame on the rite card.[#]()",
      "title": "Small column",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    },
